  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "#### Additions\n- Introduced `FilePathResolverBase` as a base class for file path resolution\n- Added `TryResolveFilePath` method to `IFilePathResolver` interface\n- Moved `PathEnvironmentVariable` class from DotExtensions into CliInvoke.Core\n\n#### Modifications\n- Updated Polyfill from 10.11.2 to 11.0.1\n- Refactored `ProcessConfiguration` constructors: moved arguments null check to 15-param ctor and delegated 3-param ctor\n- Removed dead protected setters on `Arguments` and `OutputRedirection` properties\n- Fixed `ProcessorAffinity` upper limit enforcement in `ProcessResourcePolicy`\n- Fixed `ProcessTimeoutPolicy` issue (#362)\n- Fixed `UserCredential` issue (#361)",
